WEBVTT

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:34.110
Oh, you've saved us!

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:38.030
I didn't think we'd find another
etiquette tutor so fast.

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:40.070
You'll be the 10th...

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:42.190
No, maybe the 15th?

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:44.360
Dear...

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:47.480
That's the music tutor and the history tutor.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:52.480
They live here, but the arithmetic
and poetry tutors commute.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:57.940
At any rate, I was a little worried since
my little brother brought you so suddenly.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.070
But you have proper table manners.

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:02.980
There's a lot of tableware you aren't
used to seeing in Florence, isn't there?

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:06.110
Y-Yes, I suppose...

00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:12.650
Before you go to my niece's house,
I will drill you hard on Venetian etiquette.

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:25.440
Katarina, didn't I tell you
to use a fork when eating?

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:26.650
It's disgraceful.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:31.190
But it's hard to eat <i>bigoli</i> with a fork.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:35.650
As you can see, no matter how old she gets,
she just can't seem to master etiquette.

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:38.110
It doesn't matter how strict you have to be.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:41.730
At least train her so that she
can be seen in public.

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:43.400
Right...

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:22.550
"Naughty Child"

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:20.860
If we're going to have class,
will you hurry up and start?

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:24.650
I want to hurry up and
finish it and go to sleep.

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:30.110
What? If we're not going to do anything,
then can I go to sleep?

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:34.230
Then, Katarina, since it's our first class,
why don't you show me everything you know first?

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:35.530
Okay?

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:37.570
Hmph.

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.820
Table manners...

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.860
Etiquette...

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:44.780
Knowledge of social skills...

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:46.820
They're all perfect.

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:50.860
Of course. There's nothing
for me to learn from you.

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:53.610
But during the meal yesterday...

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:56.280
Oh, that? I was faking it.

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:57.030
Huh?

00:03:57.030 --> 00:04:02.320
I'm saying, I pretend I can't do it
in front of Father and Mother.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:05.440
I've actually already mastered
all the etiquette I need to know,

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:08.480
and I think I'd be fine in public...

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:11.900
But I don't want them to know.

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:12.940
Why not?

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.280
No reason.

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:20.110
There's no specific reason, but don't you
think it's tiresome? It's just a pain.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:26.320
I want more time to rest.
Like right now, I'm sleepy.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:27.900
Besides...

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.070
If I don't pretend to not be able to do it,

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:33.570
then tutors like you will
be out of a job, right?

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:38.650
Just accept your good luck and
pretend like you're teaching me.

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:51.650
I feel like she said something crazy,
but I can't get my head around it.

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:56.070
That's...

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:58.070
Daphne!

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:00.570
That was your name, right? Hello!

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.860
U-Um...

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.440
It's about Lady Katarina, right?

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.070
This isn't something she just started doing.

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:11.980
Then, all the other tutors have also...

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:18.980
Yes. All the tutors that have quit up until now
couldn't stand her attitude any longer.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:22.690
She always ignores the tutor and falls asleep.

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:25.780
Do Lady Sofia and Lord Malta know about this?

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:31.530
No. Lady Katarina does what she is told
in front of her parents and the other tutors.

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:35.860
And us servants don't want
to get involved in any trouble...

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:39.900
So that's why everyone else quit...

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:44.900
These are layout suggestions for your portrait.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.860
Thank you.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:51.110
I like all of them. I can't decide.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:52.610
Um...

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:55.610
How is Katarina?
Are your lessons going well?

00:05:55.610 --> 00:06:00.440
U-Um... Well...

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:05.900
We've hired many people for the position
up until now, but no one worked out...

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:11.530
But I have high hopes for you,
since Yuri brought you to us.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:13.860
Please do your best with her.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:20.030
Hm... I don't know what to do...

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:22.610
Katarina always goes to sleep right away,

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:26.530
and no matter who I ask,
I can't get any useful information...

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:36.320
The air in Venice is completely
different from Florence...

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:40.360
It seems so clear, and smells like the ocean...

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:43.860
Portrait artists are a dime a dozen in Venice.

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:50.150
But I still chose you because I think
you're suited to being my niece's tutor.

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:58.030
Yuri hired me because of his expectations
for me as a tutor, not as a painter.

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:03.110
At this rate, I'll end up going home
without doing anything helpful.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:08.480
If that happens, then I won't
be able to face Leo...

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:12.110
Ow... My stomach's started hurting...

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:14.650
"Sharp pain"

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:16.860
This is no good. I need to just go to sleep
without thinking about anything.

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:20.780
Hm? Is that Katarina's room?

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:25.480
I thought I saw some light coming out of it,

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:28.650
but what's she doing awake
in the middle of the night?

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:36.360
Huh? A church near here?

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:37.440
Yes.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:41.440
I don't have anything in the morning today,
so I wanted to go look at some paintings.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:46.230
In that case, I'll write down
directions for you.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:48.820
You painters sure are studious.

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:54.190
Huh? Oh, that's part of it,
but I also wanted a change of pace...

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:59.150
I think I'll take you there myself after all.

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:02.900
Oh, no, it's fine. I feel bad making you
come with me when you're busy.

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:05.980
Venice has a lot of alleys,
and it's easy to get lost.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.650
Please wait a moment. I'll go get permission.

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:11.780
Th-Thanks...

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.230
Thanks for bringing me here.

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:27.820
I want to do some sketches,
so you can go home first.

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:31.440
It's fine. I'll wait until you're finished.

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:38.900
Oh? You're pretty good.

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:41.820
I actually belong to a workshop in Florence.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:43.980
A girl in a workshop?

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:49.190
What, is Florence so short on men
that they'll let girls be artisans?

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:52.980
I guess the "flowering capital" has withered,
huh? For a girl to be a painter!

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:55.730
H-Hey, you two!

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:59.030
How dare they!

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:03.280
Huh?

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:05.980
Arte?

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.320
U-Um...

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.940
Oh, I was just thinking that they don't
change no matter where I go.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:16.820
Huh?

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:21.440
Ah, I think I was overwhelmed
by the air in Venice.

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:25.980
It's not completely different from Florence.
Some parts are the same.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:28.860
Just because my work is
a little different from before,

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:32.940
and the people around me have changed...
There are things that haven't changed.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:35.860
Nothing about <i>me</i> has changed, either.

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:38.940
Are you all right? About earlier...

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:42.360
I'm fine! It doesn't bother me at all!

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:44.440
I'm used to stuff like that!

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:45.980
U-Used to it?

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.980
Yeah, that's right...

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:52.530
All I can do is do my best,
like I've always done!

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:57.860
So anyway, Katarina,

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:03.940
I want you to tell me why you won't
use proper etiquette in public.

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:08.070
More importantly, what's with that outfit?

00:10:08.070 --> 00:10:13.030
Huh? Well, this is what I always wear for work.

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:15.190
Is it a little dirty?

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:18.030
But it's really easy to move in!

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:22.110
Well, what you wear has nothing to do with me.

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:26.900
Anyway... just don't get in the way of my nap.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.530
Wh-Wh-Wha...?

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:36.820
Oh, these clothes really are easier to
move around in! I made the right choice!

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:42.400
Now, Katarina. If you don't take a nap,
then we've got plenty of time!

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:44.780
Please, explain yourself.

00:10:45.730 --> 00:10:48.280
I decided to use extreme measures.

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:52.360
And? Did Lady Katarina say anything?

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:57.570
No, unfortunately not.
But I didn't let her take a nap.

00:10:57.570 --> 00:11:03.030
I have confidence in my physical strength.
Don't underestimate workshop work.

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:06.320
I won't let her sleep until she talks!

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:11.360
Even if she has perfect etiquette
and doesn't need to learn from me,

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:15.150
if she doesn't use it in public,
then it's the same as not learning it at all.

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:18.860
That's why I need to do what I can as her tutor.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:22.280
Apparently, I have an ally, too.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.820
It's not like I'm an ally...

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:29.190
I brought what I said I would bring--

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:31.780
Old cloth that was going to be thrown away.

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:33.780
Oh, thanks!

00:11:33.780 --> 00:11:36.320
What are you going to do with this?

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:39.980
Just a little something!
All right, I'm gonna work tonight!

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:43.440
It's so dusty!

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:46.190
You don't have to be so on guard.

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:49.780
It's because you forced me to sit on the chair.

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:52.480
I won't do that today!

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:57.190
Instead, I'll have you change into this dress
that took me three nights to make,

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:58.900
and we'll have class outdoors!

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:01.190
Let's become better friends today!

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:03.860
Huh? Friends?

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:08.690
There aren't many people here,
so it's perfect for outdoor class!

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:12.230
I was worried about the size,
but I'm glad it fit!

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:15.150
If you wear that, then you don't
have to worry about getting dirty!

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:18.570
Right... I don't really care about that,

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:20.940
but what have you been
trying to do this whole time?

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:22.610
Huh?

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:26.780
Hang on one second.
Let me just... take this apart...

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:28.650
One more push!

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:32.030
Ta-da!

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:34.900
Let's use this to play hoop rolling!

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:37.860
Huh? It's not going where I want it to...

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:41.730
Ahh... This is hard...!

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:44.360
Katarina, you be careful, too--

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:45.690
Huh?

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:50.110
Wow, Katarina! You're good at this!

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:54.570
Of course I am! I played this a lot
in the place where I used to live.

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:55.440
Huh?

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:57.320
I'm going first!

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:59.730
If you're too slow,
I'm going to leave you behind!

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:02.400
Hey! Wait up!

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.440
I'm beat.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:12.320
You didn't wait for me at all.
I had to run as fast as I could.

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:16.110
It's preposterous to wait!
Because this is a competition!

00:13:16.110 --> 00:13:19.070
Oh, I'm hungry now after moving so much.

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:21.570
That dinner we had my first day was delicious.

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:24.530
Especially that veal stew...

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.610
Oh, that dish?

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:31.400
Other than raisins, there was ginger,
cinnamon, and black pepper in that.

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:33.980
And you could just taste
the vinegar in the red wine...

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:37.320
Katarina, you sure know a lot!

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:40.030
Did you talk to the cook?

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:41.440
Y-Yeah, right.

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:43.280
I see.

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:45.230
By the way, Katarina...

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:48.440
Won't you talk to me properly now? Why--?

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:53.570
There's no reason why I won't
use proper etiquette in public.

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:56.190
You just spoiled the fun.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:57.320
I'm going back.

00:13:57.320 --> 00:14:01.530
If I move around too much, then I get sleepy
too fast at night, and it's a problem.

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:02.400
Huh?

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.230
I-It's nothing.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:07.190
I'll play with you again tomorrow, Teacher.

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:09.190
Hey, Katarina--

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:13.940
Arte.

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:15.030
Yes?

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:17.940
Since then, how have you and
Katarina been getting along?

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:20.480
Huh? Um, uh...

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:23.900
Everything's going smoothly, Lady Sofia...

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:26.730
You're trying to spare my feelings, aren't you?

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:29.690
It hasn't worked no matter
what we've tried up until now.

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:33.320
I'm not expecting you to
be able to do it right away.

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:34.820
That girl and I...

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:38.570
We haven't really been able to
open our hearts to each other.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:44.280
Other than Katarina,
we have two boys in our family.

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:49.730
Right after they were born,
they were all sent to our villa to be raised.

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:51.570
Katarina, too, then?

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:52.570
Yes.

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:55.400
Normally, they would be returned
to us after about two years,

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:58.610
but it took a long time for her to be returned.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:04.280
Malta, my husband, wasn't interested
in children who were not boys.

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:06.610
That girl will one day
be sent off to be married.

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:08.780
She's just going to cost us money.

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:13.900
In the end, she only came back
to us recently, when she was six.

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:17.360
Since her return,
on my husband's instructions,

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:23.320
she's just been drilled on culture and manners
so as not to embarrass the family name.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:29.730
That's why I feel like Katarina hasn't
opened up her heart to anyone in this house.

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:34.360
I wonder if Katarina pretending
not to know any manners

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:39.530
is related to her living at
the villa for a long time?

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:41.230
Also...

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:46.610
...why is it a problem for her to
get sleepy too quickly at night?

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:54.360
Katarina's room...

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:58.820
Oh, yeah. I thought I saw light
in there the other night...

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:03.360
Um, Katarina? It's Arte.

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:05.530
You're still awake, right?

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:13.110
Katarina! Are you all right?!

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:15.650
What's wrong?! I'm opening the door!

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:25.690
Books about cooking...

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:28.280
Katarina, you...

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:31.150
Why are <i>you</i> here?

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:37.360
I-I wanted to know why you're so
unmotivated about etiquette, so...

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:39.610
I see...

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:42.900
Are you satisfied now that
you've exposed my secret?

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:44.150
That's not what I was trying--

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:46.110
Too bad, though!

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:49.610
The fact that I don't want
to act like a noble in public

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.570
and my interest in cooking aren't related.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:56.570
Go ahead. Go report this to Father and Mother.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:17:00.530
Cooking is something that should be
done by employees and servants.

00:17:00.530 --> 00:17:05.280
I'm sure Father will forbid me
from ever cooking again.

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:11.690
But unfortunately, even that won't
make me want to act properly in public.

00:17:11.690 --> 00:17:15.190
Katarina, um, that's not what I meant--

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:16.860
Get out.

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:23.190
I'm sorry.

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:31.860
I'm so dumb...

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:38.030
Put one whole capon into the pot,

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:42.820
and add carrots, onions,
celery, parsley, and garlic.

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:45.610
Boil well, skimming off the scum
from the top as it cooks.

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:48.480
And then, you'll be left with a golden <i>brodo</i> .

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:52.860
Then, add lasagna made from high-quality flour.

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:57.650
Once it's cooked, put it on a plate,
and sprinkle with grated cheese.

00:17:57.650 --> 00:18:01.780
Repeat several times, and then...

00:18:01.780 --> 00:18:06.280
Yum, it's seasoned well with the saltiness
of the <i>brodo</i> and cheese.

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:10.570
Stop tasting the food! Hurry up
and put the cheese on, Uncle!

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:12.610
The lasagna's getting cold!

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:14.480
Yes, ma'am.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:19.530
By the way, are things going well
with your new tutor?

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:24.190
I thought she was more interesting
than the other tutors I've had,

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:27.690
but this might be the last
time I can cook here...

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:28.570
Huh?

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:30.480
Nothing.

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:34.110
Come on, let's eat this with everyone.

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:39.690
Father...?

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:51.650
What, you can't even say goodbye
to your father when he's going out?

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:52.190
Huh?

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:55.110
Katarina, don't you have class?

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.570
Go inside.

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.150
What?

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:02.190
Nothing... happened...

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:06.530
Now, Katarina, it's time for class.

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:09.440
You didn't tell my parents about what you saw?

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:11.400
No, I didn't.

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:12.280
Why not?

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:17.320
I was hired to be a portrait painter and tutor.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:22.110
I didn't come to take what
you like away from you.

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:26.570
Besides, I know how much it hurts to have
what you like taken away from you.

00:19:26.570 --> 00:19:30.400
My mother burned my drawings before.

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:31.690
Huh?

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:34.320
But well, even after so much opposition,

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:39.900
I still ended up being an apprentice at
a workshop and coming all the way here.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:42.570
Even after so much opposition...

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:44.980
You still liked art?

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:49.780
That's right. That's not the only reason
I wanted to become a painter, though.

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:53.530
Do you want to look at my drawings?

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:59.860
Wow! Do you sketch everything
you see when you walk around?

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:01.570
Yes, that's right.

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:08.110
Recording everything I see like this
comes in handy when I'm painting for work.

00:20:08.110 --> 00:20:10.980
It can all be used as reference for work.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:13.730
This is a painter's fortune.

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:17.570
You used to be a noble, right?

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:23.480
The only daughter of poor nobles who could
barely manage enough for one dowry.

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:25.940
Wasn't it hard to live such
a different lifestyle?

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:28.070
Hard...?

00:20:29.650 --> 00:20:31.730
Nights were hard.

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:32.530
Nights?

00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:37.360
That's right. I'd be <i>so</i> exhausted,
it was hard to keep my eyes open.

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:42.230
Also, we work in a hurry, so my body was
always covered with cuts and bruises.

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:45.400
And I'm always sore.

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:48.280
B-But it's not all bad!

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:52.320
I became friends with the bread baker
and got to hear stories from him

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:56.030
and bought food from the
marketplace to eat during breaks.

00:20:56.030 --> 00:21:01.070
And sometimes, on my days off, the other
apprentices and I play and get muddy.

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:04.400
There are a ton of fun things about it, too!

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:08.940
I get it.

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:09.900
Huh?

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:12.940
You said your name was Arte, right?

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:15.190
Yeah, I'm Arte! Arte.

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:21.360
Man, you never called me by my name,
so I thought you didn't remember it...

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:24.730
Do people say you're strange?

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:27.570
Well? Has anyone ever said that?

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:29.030
L...

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:32.730
Lots of times...

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:34.030
I knew it!

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:38.150
Uncle Yuri brought you,
so there's no way you're normal.

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:39.780
Huh?

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:42.530
I think maybe you really are interesting.

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:43.230
Huh?

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:47.730
Hey, you have other drawings,
too, right? I want to see more!

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:53.320
Arte?

00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:57.570
Katarina, I'm really very sorry
that I pushed my way into your room.

00:21:57.570 --> 00:22:02.480
I wanted to know what was in your heart.
But I do think I acted too forward.

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:04.190
I won't ask anymore.

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:06.280
I won't force you to tell me.

00:22:06.280 --> 00:22:10.780
I'll wait until you feel
like telling me yourself.

00:22:12.610 --> 00:22:16.530
Arte, do you want to come over for dinner?

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:17.940
Huh?

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:20.320
I don't mind telling you there.

00:22:20.320 --> 00:22:22.690
About myself...

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:25.190
About what you want to know.

00:23:56.070 --> 00:23:59.440
"Preview"

00:23:56.820 --> 00:23:59.900
Katarina, you've got a complicated past, huh?

00:23:59.900 --> 00:24:02.440
I didn't live a straightforward life like you.

00:24:02.440 --> 00:24:05.610
I'll do my best to understand the
feelings you can't put into words!

00:24:04.780 --> 00:24:11.050
"Katarina's Dinner"

00:24:05.610 --> 00:24:07.650
Next time, "Katarina's Dinner."

00:24:07.650 --> 00:24:11.030
Delicious food softens hearts!
